        "tree_id": "02f2b7b637adfafca84f2de96cfb590154438b19",
        "message": "fix: 4 issues found in architecture review\n\n1. uploadBackupCandidatesAndWait: hadFailure was never assigned, so\n   failures never triggered a WorkManager retry. Now counts via the\n   onUploadStatus callback chain.\n2. Call FileDownloader.start() after enqueue as a safety net (no-op when\n   nothing is paused; failures ignored).\n3. Guard getActiveTasks() against exceptions mid-poll.\n4. Patch 03: unlock() before handoff had no timeout and could stall the\n   app-pause path; now bounded to 1.5s.\n5. Patch 01/02: removed the dead 55-minute constant from 01 (02 owns the\n   budget) and gave maxMinutes=null a 55-minute fallback in 02.\n\nAll five patches verified end-to-end against a clean v3.3.5 checkout.",
